### SAM 2 Architecture\
**Model:** facebook/sam2-hiera-large  \
**Encoder:** Hiera \'97 Hierarchical Vision Transformer  \
**Decoder:** Streaming Memory Attention + Mask Decoder  \
**Parameters:** ~224M \'b7 Released by Meta AI FAIR, August 2024\
\
---\
### Auto-Prompt Engine\
Rather than requiring manual clicks, the system:\
- Applies **CLAHE** contrast enhancement to boost tumor signal\
- Thresholds the **top 10% intensity pixels** (tumors are hyper-intense on T1/FLAIR)\
- Cleans artifacts with **morphological open/close** operations\
- Strips **skull and image-border noise** (10% margin mask)\
- Extracts **bounding boxes + center points** as SAM 2 prompts automatically\
- Picks the **highest IoU mask** per detected region from SAM 2's outputs\
\
---\
### Dataset Compatibility\
Works best with: T1-contrast, T2, FLAIR axial MRI slices  \
Compatible formats: JPG \'b7 PNG \'b7 TIFF \'b7 DICOM screenshots\
